description:
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---
- Product name is Listwell. Do not use Visimate in UI, copy, metadata, package name, titles, or README except one MIT origin mention of drevantonder/visimate.
- Use `bun` to install node packages.
- Next.js App Router + OpenNext Cloudflare Workers (wrangler).
- UI follows docs/DESIGN.md: Geist Sans/Mono, sentence-case, one continuous canvas. No Vercel wordmark or triangle.
- Use Zod for types and type safety
- Avoid premature optimization and remember KISS
- Prefer adding to pre-existing files, rather than creating new ones
- Database is sqlite / D1 with drizzle
- Prefer typescript inference
- Use conventional commits
- Don't use `any` or `as`. Use zod to parse and throw an error if the result doesn't match
